WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.963
Here's what you'll be able to
do by the end of this module.

2
00:00:02.963 --> 00:00:05.989
You'll normalize a Zero
Trust Assessment export

3
00:00:05.989 --> 00:00:08.637
and read its counts by
result and by pillar.

4
00:00:08.637 --> 00:00:13.174
You'll work the dispositions for results
that are neither a pass nor a finding.

5
00:00:13.174 --> 00:00:16.137
You'll record the review
of an investigate result.

6
00:00:16.137 --> 00:00:19.542
You'll read a closure-register
entry and say what's filled,

7
00:00:19.542 --> 00:00:22.150
what a person fills,
and who decides closure.

8
00:00:22.150 --> 00:00:25.347
And you'll route a finding to
its family's remediation page,

9
00:00:25.347 --> 00:00:27.212
and check an exception's approver.

10
00:00:27.212 --> 00:00:31.962
You need Module 1, and Module 2's
Lab 2 for this module's Lab 2.

11
00:00:31.962 --> 00:00:37.329
In Unit 2 you'll read two chapters of Zero
Trust and Assessment: Close Before You

12
00:00:37.329 --> 00:00:42.910
Assess, for the finding families, and
Evidence, Not Verdicts, for the closure chain.
